# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Package-manager lock files
#
# Manifests such as package.json, pyproject.toml, Cargo.toml, go.mod,
# pom.xml, etc. remain indexed.
#
# Lock files are normally generated and often extremely large.
# Especially pnpm-lock.yaml would otherwise be treated as YAML/document
# content and can add substantial noise/cost.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

package-lock.json
npm-shrinkwrap.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
yarn.lock
bun.lock
bun.lockb

Pipfile.lock
poetry.lock
uv.lock

composer.lock
Gemfile.lock

Cargo.lock
go.sum

pubspec.lock
Podfile.lock
Package.resolved


